e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +3 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1973","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-washington","name":"Washington","code":"WAS","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 340)","str":84.3,"squad":[["Billy Kilmer","QB",83],["Sonny Jurgensen","QB",74],["Larry Brown","RB",85],["Moses Denson","RB",79],["Charley Taylor","WR",91],["Roy Jefferson","WR",86],["Frank Grant","WR",68],["Bill Malinchak","WR",55],["Jerry Smith","TE",88],["Alvin Reed","TE",59],["George Starke","OL",91],["Len Hauss","OL",91],["Paul Laaveg","OL",91],["Walt Sweeney","OL",90],["Ray Schoenke","OL",78],["Jim Tyrer","OL",59],["Dan Ryczek","OL",55],["Diron Talbert","DL",92],["Bill Brundige","DL",80],["Verlon Biggs","DL",80],["Ron McDole","DL",77],["Deacon Jones","DL",65],["Dennis Johnson","DL",62],["Chris Hanburger","LB",99],["Dave Robinson","LB",89],["Harold McLinton","LB",76],["Mike Bass","CB",89],["Pat Fischer","CB",82],["Larry Jones","CB",61],["Brig Owens","S",84],["Ken Houston","S",79],["Ken Stone","S",64],["Mark Moseley","K",86]]},{"id":"nfl-oakland-raiders","name":"Oakland Raiders","code":"OAK","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 191)","str":83,"squad":[["Ken Stabler","QB",93],["Larry Lawrence","QB",57],["Marv Hubbard","RB",83],["Clarence Davis","RB",76],["Cliff Branch","WR",97],["Fred Biletnikoff","WR",87],["Mike Siani","WR",60],["Frank Pitts","WR",56],["Bob Moore","TE",81],["Dave Casper","TE",57],["Art Shell","OL",96],["Gene Upshaw","